{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared golden vectors for the three aggregations behind the Statistics screen",
    "and the PDF report: the category breakdown, the 24-hour histogram and the eight",
    "3-hour buckets. Loaded by BOTH suites: StatsAggregatorVectorTest.kt drives",
    "domain/StatsAggregator.kt, StatsAggregatorVectorTest.swift drives",
    "PotillusKit's StatsAggregator. Until the v0.86.0 review the Kotlin side had the",
    "histogram written out twice (StatsViewModel, PdfReportData) and none of the",
    "three under test.",
    "Every entry carries utcOffsetSeconds, so the clock hour is fixed by the file and",
    "no test depends on the machine's zone: the hour is read in the frame the drink",
    "was logged in. Entries are objects with drinkId, gramsAlcohol, timestampMillis,",
    "utcOffsetSeconds; drinks are [id, category] pairs. A drinkId with no drink",
    "counts as OTHER."
  ],
